1
00:00:00,759 --> 00:00:03,189
(Howard:)Can we just all agree
we're worried about Affleck?

2
00:00:03,195 --> 00:00:05,325
(Stuart:)Sure.
Yeah, of course.

3
00:00:06,665 --> 00:00:08,665
(Adam:)What's an Affleck?

4
00:00:11,603 --> 00:00:14,303
(Sheldon:)Is there a reason I had
to leave my own apartment?

5
00:00:14,306 --> 00:00:15,976
(Amy:)Well, I think
they just want you to see it

6
00:00:15,974 --> 00:00:17,574
(Amy:)for the first time
all decorated.

7
00:00:17,576 --> 00:00:21,246
(Sheldon:)But who's gonna tell them
they're doing it wrong?

8
00:00:21,246 --> 00:00:24,476
(Amy:)Well, I'm... I'm sure they'll
ask you to give a speech,

9
00:00:24,482 --> 00:00:27,222
(Amy:)and that's when
you just tear 'em a new one.

10
00:00:27,219 --> 00:00:30,119
(Amy:)Have to say, you...

11
00:00:30,121 --> 00:00:32,051
(Amy:)you do look good in that suit.

12
00:00:32,057 --> 00:00:33,487
(Sheldon:)Oh. Thank you.

13
00:00:33,491 --> 00:00:35,621
(Amy:)Maybe later I'll, uh...

14
00:00:35,627 --> 00:00:39,367
(Amy:)get to see you
in your birthday suit.

15
00:00:41,633 --> 00:00:44,303
But this is my
birthday suit.

16
00:00:45,737 --> 00:00:48,507
(Sheldon:)Are you having a stroke?

17
00:00:49,941 --> 00:00:51,141
(Sheldon:)Because that's the kind of thing

18
00:00:51,142 --> 00:00:52,572
(Sheldon:)that just ruins
a birthday party.

19
00:00:55,013 --> 00:00:57,543
(Leonard:)So, Mother, I'm surprised
you came all this way

20
00:00:57,549 --> 00:00:58,649
(Leonard:)for Sheldon's birthday.

21
00:00:58,650 --> 00:00:59,780
(Beverley:)Oh, I was happy to.

22
00:00:59,784 --> 00:01:01,714
(Beverley:)He did come to my 60th.

